<title>FRANCE: French non-farm payrolls rose 0.1 pct in Q4.</title>
<headline>French non-farm payrolls rose 0.1 pct in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The labour ministry/national statistics institute INSEE gave the following preliminary seasonally adjusted payrolls data, in millions unless stated</p>
<p>				   Q4     Q3    Q4 95  Q4 chg  96/95 chg</p>
<p>								(pct)    (pct)</p>
<p> Total			  13.34  13.33  13.35   0.1     -0.1</p>
<p> Industry excl. building   4.07   4.09   4.15  -0.3     -1.8</p>
<p> Industry incl. building   5.19   5.21   5.31  -0.5     -2.4</p>
<p> Building			1.11   1.13   1.17  -1.1     -4.7</p>
<p> Services			8.16   8.12   8.04   0.5	1.5</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
</text>
